        // Marrow: new 4586b8 -> 4586bd (4d8), construct 4586d3 ->
        // 4586d8; inherited base 458d65 -> 458d6a and 40e0f2 -> 40e0f7.
        // Siren: new 489768 -> 48976d (4b0), construct 489783 -> 489788;
        // slots +10/+20/+1c return 48979d/4897aa/4897ce; lifecycle 4897bc -> 4897c1.
        // Balanced base CALL 489c74 -> 489c79 keeps the physical caller's x87 environment.
